0..59 Comment "//! `held-within` keeps a view past the hold that lends it."
60..63 Comment "//!"
64..132 Comment "//! Each view escapes its hold. The checker refuses both programs as"
133..151 Comment "//! `ViewEscaped`."
152..155 Comment "//!"
156..232 Comment "//! The source keeps each view at a handler region. The binding of a handler"
233..311 Comment "//! opens no region of its own. Rust rejects a block reference after its local"
312..371 Comment "//! ends. The source imports the early exit host interface."
372..375 Comment "//!"
376..433 Comment "//! - see: #1494 — `keptPastHold`, `keptPastNestedHold`"
